# Material file for cube.obj
newmtl Material
Ka 0.2 0.2 0.2      # Ambient color (dark grey)
Kd 0.0 0.8 0.0      # Diffuse color (light grey)
Ks 0.0 0.0 0.0      # Specular color (none)
Ns 10.0             # Shininess
d 1.0               # Opacity (1.0 = fully opaque)
illum 2             # Illumination model
```

Just save this as `cube.mtl` and place it in the same folder as your `cube.obj`:
```
~/.gazebo/models/cube/meshes/cube.mtl